  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<p data-start=\"1001\" data-end=\"1088\">A <strong data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1028\">higher PRA percentage</strong> indicates broader sensitization to HLA Class II antigens.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1199\">\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1199\"><strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1100\">&gt; 80%</strong> may indicate difficulty in finding a compatible donor and a higher risk of transplant rejection.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1310\">\n<p data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1310\">Consider <strong data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1244\">donor-specific antibody (DSA)</strong> testing and <strong data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1271\">HLA typing</strong> for detailed compatibility assessment.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
